msgid "Projection-based WF-in-DFT embedding"
msgstr "投影式 WF-in-DFT 嵌入"

msgid ""
"Embedding methods allow a system to be divided into two smaller subsystems, "
"each of which can be treated using a different level of theory. For example,"
" in wavefunction-in-DFT (WF-in-DFT) embedding, a WF-level (e.g. HF, MP2, "
"CCSD(T), CASSCF, etc.) calculation is performed on one subsystem, while a "
"DFT-level calculation is performed on the other subsystem. The interactions "
"between the two subsystems are calculated at the DFT level. The primary "
"advantage of WF-in-DFT embedding is that it facilitates the application of "
"an accurate, systematically improvable WF method to regions where such "
"accuracy is required, while a more efficient DFT method is applied to the "
"remainder of the system. The overall strategy for projection-based WF-in-DFT"
" embedding is described as follows:"
msgstr ""
"嵌入方法允许将一个体系划分为两个较小的子系统，每个子系统可以采用不同的理论水平进行处理。例如，在波函数嵌入密度泛函理论（WF-in-"
"DFT）嵌入中，对一个子系统执行波函数水平（例如 HF、MP2、CCSD(T)、CASSCF 等）的计算，而对另一个子系统执行 DFT "
"水平的计算。两个子系统之间的相互作用在 DFT 水平上计算。WF-in-DFT "
"嵌入的主要优点是，它便于在需要高精度的区域应用精确、可系统改进的波函数方法，而对体系其余部分应用更高效的 DFT 方法。投影式 WF-in-DFT "
"嵌入的总体策略描述如下："

msgid "Note: WF-in-DFT embedding is not implemented with symmetry."
msgstr "注意：WF-in-DFT 嵌入未实现对称性。"

msgid ""
"It is possible to replace the WF-level calculation on subsystem A with a "
"DFT-level calculation, which corresponds to DFT-in-DFT embedding. Since the "
"interaction potential between the subsystems is calculated at the DFT level,"
" the result of a DFT-in-DFT embedding calculation is numerically identical "
"to the results of a DFT calculation on the full system. Similarly, it is "
"possible to replace the DFT-level calculation with a HF-level calculation, "
"which corresponds to WF-in-HF embedding."
msgstr ""
"可以将子系统 A 上的波函数级别计算替换为 DFT 级别计算，这对应于 DFT-in-DFT 嵌入。由于子系统之间的相互作用势是在 DFT "
"级别计算的，因此 DFT-in-DFT 嵌入计算的结果在数值上与对整个系统进行 DFT 计算的结果相同。类似地，可以将 DFT 级别计算替换为 HF "
"级别计算，这对应于 WF-in-HF 嵌入。"

msgid ""
"Molpro implements the numerically exact projection-based WF-in-DFT embedding"
" method for open and closed shell systems developed in the following papers:"
msgstr "Molpro 实现了以下论文中开发的、用于开壳层和闭壳层系统的数值精确的投影式 WF-in-DFT 嵌入方法："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from the use of this method must acknowledge the "
"above."
msgstr "所有使用此方法发表的出版物必须引用上述文献。"

msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

msgid ""
"The WF-in-DFT embedding program is called by the ``EMBED`` directive. When "
"using this directive, the user must specify which MOs are associated with "
"the active subsystem. This can be most directly accomplished through the "
"``ORBS`` option:"
msgstr ""
"波函数嵌入密度泛函理论程序通过 ``EMBED`` 指令调用。使用此指令时，用户必须指定哪些分子轨道与活性子系统相关联。这可以通过 ``ORBS`` "
"选项最直接地完成："

msgid ""
"``ORBS``\\ =\\ *[orbital1,orbital2,orbital3...]* where *orbital1* is an "
"integer indicating that MO number *orbital1* is associated with the active "
"subsystem. The minimum input to run using the ``ORBS`` array is: ``proc "
"ccsdt_proc`` ``endproc`` ``{ks}`` ``{=[orbital1]}``"
msgstr ""
"``ORBS``\\ =\\ *[orbital1,orbital2,orbital3…]* 其中 *orbital1* 是一个整数，表示第 "
"*orbital1* 号分子轨道与活性子系统相关联。使用 ``ORBS`` 数组运行的最小输入为： ``proc ccsdt_proc`` "
"``endproc`` ``{ks}`` ``{=[orbital1]}``"

msgid ""
"The KS calculation is performed on the full system. The ``EMBED`` directive "
"indicates the beginning of an embedding calculation in which subsystem A "
"corresponds to the single MO *orbital1*. The HF and CCSD(T) calculations are"
" performed on subsystem A, embedded in a subsystem interaction potential "
"calculated at the KS level."
msgstr ""
"KS 计算在整个系统上进行。\\ ``EMBED`` 指令表示嵌入计算的开始，其中子系统 A 对应于单个分子轨道 *orbital1*\\ 。HF 和 "
"CCSD(T) 计算在子系统 A 上进行，该子系统嵌入在 KS 级别计算的子系统相互作用势中。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively to setting the ``ORBS`` array, the user can instead specify "
"the ``ATOMS`` option:"
msgstr "除了设置 ``ORBS`` 数组，用户也可以指定 ``ATOMS`` 选项："

msgid ""
"CASSCF calculations can be used as the WF method, but some care must be "
"taken for the specification of the active space. In particular, the ``OCC``,"
" ``CLOSED``, and ``FROZEN`` cards must be specified, and they must "
"correspond to the number of ``OCC``, ``CLOSED``, and ``FROZEN`` orbitals "
"within the active subsystem:"
msgstr ""
"CASSCF 计算可用作波函数方法，但在指定活性空间时必须注意。特别是，必须指定 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED`` 和 "
"``FROZEN`` 卡片，并且它们必须对应于活性子系统内 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED`` 和 ``FROZEN`` 轨道的数量："

msgid "``proc multi_proc``"
msgstr "``proc multi_proc``"

msgid "``endproc``"
msgstr "``endproc``"

msgid "``{ks}``"
msgstr "``{ks}``"

msgid "``{[atom1,atom2,...]}``"
msgstr "``{[atom1,atom2,...]}``"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "EMBED Options"
msgstr "EMBED 选项"

msgid "The following options may be specified on the ``EMBED`` command line:"
msgstr "以下选项可在 ``EMBED`` 命令行中指定："

msgid ""
"``ORBS``\\ =\\ *[orbital1,orbital2,orbital3...]* The ORBS option is "
"described in the section Getting Started (`getting Started <projection-"
"based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#getting-started>`__)."
msgstr ""
"``ORBS``\\ =\\ *[orbital1,orbital2,orbital3…]* ORBS 选项在入门章节（\\ `getting "
"Started <projection-based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#getting-started>`__\\ "
"）中描述。"

msgid ""
"``ATOMS``\\ =\\ *[atom1,atom2,atom3...]* The ATOMS option is described in "
"the section Getting Started (`getting Started <projection-based_wf-in-"
"dft_embedding.html#getting-started>`__)."
msgstr ""
"``ATOMS``\\ =\\ *[atom1,atom2,atom3…]* ATOMS 选项在入门章节中有描述（\\ `入门 <projection-"
"based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#getting-started>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``MU``\\ =value (default 1.d6) The value of the coefficient for the level "
"shift used in the projection-based embedding calculations. The projection-"
"based embedding method is in principle numerically exact in the limit of "
"infinite ``MU``, but in practice very large values of ``MU`` will lead to "
"machine-precision errors. Typically, changing ``MU`` by 1-2 orders of "
"magnitude relative to the default value should have only negligible impact "
"on the energy."
msgstr ""
"``MU``\\ =值（默认 1.d6）用于投影式嵌入计算中的能级位移系数值。投影式嵌入方法在原则上当 ``MU`` "
"趋于无穷大时是数值精确的，但在实践中，非常大的 ``MU`` 值会导致机器精度误差。通常，相对于默认值改变 ``MU`` 1-2 "
"个数量级对能量的影响可以忽略不计。"

msgid ""
"``CHARGE_THRESHOLD``\\ =value (default 0.4) This option is only relevant if "
"the ``ATOMS`` option is present. Any MO having a summed Mulliken population "
"on atoms specified by the ``ATOMS`` option that is greater than "
"``CHARGE_THRESHOLD`` is associated with the active subsystem."
msgstr ""
"``CHARGE_THRESHOLD``\\ =值（默认 0.4）此选项仅在 ``ATOMS`` 选项存在时相关。任何在 ``ATOMS`` "
"选项指定的原子上 Mulliken 布居总和大于 ``CHARGE_THRESHOLD`` 的 MO 将被关联到活性子系统。"

msgid ""
"``N_ORBITALS``\\ =value (default none) If the ``ATOMS`` option is present, "
"as an alternative to defining ``CHARGE_THRESHOLD``, one can instead define "
"``N_ORBITALS``. In this case, the ``N_ORBITALS`` MOs with the largest summed"
" Mulliken population on the atoms specified by the ``ATOMS`` option are "
"associated with the active system. This can be particularly useful for "
"ensuring that the number of MOs in the active subsystem remains constant "
"when calculating the potential energy surface of a reaction."
msgstr ""
"``N_ORBITALS``\\ =值（默认 无）如果 ``ATOMS`` 选项存在，作为定义 ``CHARGE_THRESHOLD`` "
"的替代方案，可以定义 ``N_ORBITALS``\\ 。在这种情况下，在 ``ATOMS`` 选项指定的原子上 Mulliken 布居总和最大的 "
"``N_ORBITALS`` 个 MO 被关联到活性系统。这在计算反应的势能面时，对于确保活性子系统中的 MO 数量保持恒定特别有用。"

msgid ""
"``LOC_METHOD``\\ =value (default ``IBBA``) When localized MOs are not "
"provided to the embedding program, determines which localization method will"
" be used to generate them. Valid options are ``IBBA`` (default), which "
"refers to Knizia’s IBO localization method ``PM``, which refers to Pipek-"
"Mezey localization, and ``NONE`` which tells the embedding program not to "
"localize the provided orbitals."
msgstr ""
"``LOC_METHOD``\\ =值（默认 ``IBBA``\\ ）当未向嵌入程序提供定域化 MO 时，决定将使用哪种定域化方法来生成它们。有效选项是"
" ``IBBA``\\ （默认），指 Knizia 的 IBO 定域化方法；\\ ``PM``\\ ，指 Pipek-Mezey 定域化；以及 "
"``NONE``\\ ，它告诉嵌入程序不要定域化所提供的轨道。"

msgid ""
"``HIGHPROC``\\ =value Name of procedure for performing the high-level "
"calculation on subsystem A."
msgstr "``HIGHPROC``\\ =值 用于在子系统 A 上执行高级计算的程序名称。"

msgid ""
"E = E_{\\text{WF-in-DFT}}^{\\text{trunc. basis}}\n"
"    + E_{\\text{DFT-in-DFT}}^{\\text{whole basis}}\n"
"    - E_{\\text{DFT-in-DFT}}^{\\text{trunc. basis}}"
msgstr ""
"E = E_{\\text{WF-in-DFT}}^{\\text{trunc. basis}}\n"
"    + E_{\\text{DFT-in-DFT}}^{\\text{whole basis}}\n"
"    - E_{\\text{DFT-in-DFT}}^{\\text{trunc. basis}}"

msgid ""
"``ORBITAL,[record],local`` This card specifies the orbital record from which"
" MOs corresponding to a HF-level or DFT-level calculation on the full system"
" are read. These MOs should be localized prior to use by the embedding "
"calculation, as shown in the following example: ``proc ccsdt_proc`` "
"``endproc`` ``{ks;orbital,2200.2}`` ``{ibba;orbital,2200.2;save,2200.2}`` "
"``{embed,highproc=ccsdt_proc,atoms=[atom1];orbital,2200.2,local}`` If this "
"card is not present, the last calculated HF or DFT MOs are localized using "
"the Intrinsic Basis Bonding Analysis algorithm and then employed by the "
"embedding calculation. Thus the preceding example is equivalent to: ``proc "
"ccsdt_proc`` ``endproc`` ``{ks}`` ``{=[atom1]}``"
msgstr ""
"``ORBITAL,[record],local`` 此卡片指定从哪个轨道记录中读取对应于整个系统 HF 级别或 DFT "
"级别计算的分子轨道。这些分子轨道在用于嵌入计算之前应进行局域化，如下例所示：\\ ``proc ccsdt_proc`` ``endproc`` "
"``{ks;orbital,2200.2}`` ``{ibba;orbital,2200.2;save,2200.2}`` "
"``{embed,highproc=ccsdt_proc,atoms=[atom1];orbital,2200.2,local}`` "
"如果此卡片不存在，则最后计算的 HF 或 DFT 分子轨道将使用本征基键合分析算法进行局域化，然后用于嵌入计算。因此，前面的示例等价于：\\ "
"``proc ccsdt_proc`` ``endproc`` ``{ks}`` ``{=[atom1]}``"

msgid ""
"``PRINT``\\ =value (default 1) Level of output. The value print=1 prints the"
" atoms and molecular orbitals in the active region, the localized molecular "
"orbital composition as well as the active and frozen electrons."
msgstr ""
"``PRINT``\\ =值 (默认 1) 输出级别。值 print=1 会打印活性区域中的原子和分子轨道、局域分子轨道的组成以及活性和冻结电子。"

msgid "SCF options related to EMBED"
msgstr "与 EMBED 相关的 SCF 选项"

msgid ""
"``HF_COR``\\ =value (default 1) By default (HF_COR=1) calculates the "
"perturbative correction to level-shift projector. This can be turned off by "
"specifying HF_COR=0. This option must be specified in the SCF directive and "
"not in the EMBED directive."
msgstr ""
"``HF_COR``\\ =值 (默认 1) 默认情况下 (HF_COR=1) 计算能级移位投影子的微扰校正。可以通过指定 HF_COR=0 "
"来关闭此功能。此选项必须在 SCF 指令中指定，而不是在 EMBED 指令中。"

msgid "Density fitting"
msgstr "密度拟合"

msgid "``{df-embed,atoms=[atom1,atom2,...]}``"
msgstr "``{df-embed,atoms=[atom1,atom2,...]}``"

msgid "Saving orbitals and densities"
msgstr "保存轨道和密度"

msgid ""
"The following options may be used to save densities and orbitals for later "
"analysis. If AO truncation is employed (``truncate``), these densities and "
"orbitals represent the truncated basis."
msgstr "以下选项可用于保存密度和轨道以供后续分析。如果使用了AO截断（\\ ``truncate``\\ ），这些密度和轨道表示的是截断后的基组。"

msgid ""
"``SAVE_DEN_A``\\ =record_name This option saves the subsystem A density to "
"the specified record."
msgstr "``SAVE_DEN_A``\\ =record_name 此选项将子系统A的密度保存到指定记录中。"

msgid ""
"``SAVE_DEN_B``\\ =record_name This option saves the subsystem B density to "
"the specified record."
msgstr "``SAVE_DEN_B``\\ =record_name 此选项将子系统B的密度保存到指定记录中。"

msgid "Improved efficiency using basis set truncation"
msgstr "使用基组截断提高效率"

msgid ""
"By default, the calculation on the active subsystem (subsystem A) is "
"performed using all basis functions employed by the calculation on the full "
"system. The computational cost of a high-level WF calculation on even a "
"small active subsystem can thus be prohibitively high if the full system is "
"sufficiently large. This cost can be greatly reduced by performing the "
"calculation on the active subsystem using only the basis functions that are "
"most important for representation of the MOs associated with the active "
"subsystem. The density threshold method is implemented to facilitate "
"truncation of the active subsystem basis set, and this method is described "
"in the subsections below."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，活性子系统（子系统 "
"A）的计算使用完整系统计算所采用的全部基函数。因此，如果完整系统足够大，即使在一个小的活性子系统上进行高级波函数计算，其计算成本也可能高得令人望而却步。通过仅使用对表示与活性子系统相关的分子轨道最重要的基函数来进行活性子系统的计算，可以大大降低这一成本。密度阈值方法被实现以促进活性子系统基组的截断，该方法将在以下小节中描述。"

msgid "Density threshold method"
msgstr "密度阈值方法"

msgid ""
"The density threshold truncation method requires just one parameter to be "
"adjusted for all types of molecular system and functions that are important "
"in the long range are automatically kept. At its low truncation limit it "
"produces the full basis embedding answer or at high truncation it’s limit is"
" a result constructed from just the functions on the active embedding "
"region. Application of this method involves slightly different input "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"密度阈值截断方法仅需调整一个参数即可适用于所有类型的分子体系，并且对长程重要的函数会自动保留。在其低截断极限下，它产生完整基组的嵌入结果；而在高截断极限下，其结果仅由活性嵌入区域上的函数构成。应用此方法涉及略有不同的输入选项："

msgid ""
"``truncate=value`` (default 0.0) The ``truncate`` option invokes the use of "
"the density threshold method, and must always be be given with a positive "
"number when this method is used. The ``truncate`` value is the minimum gross"
" Mulliken population that each basis function is compared against. "
"Environment functions with a greater gross populations than this value are "
"grouped (according to angular momentum partners i.e px, with py and pz) and "
"are kept. Environment functions lower than truncate are grouped and "
"discarded from the post embedding calculation. Setting ``truncate=0.0`` is "
"equivalent to the case in which the basis set is not truncated as all "
"functions have a gross population greater than 0. For accurate type-in-type "
"energies, ``truncate`` should typically be no more than 0.001, although "
"convergence with respect to this parameter slightly varies according to the "
"system and degree of delocalization. For example: ``proc ccsdt_proc`` "
"``endproc`` ``{ks;orbital,2100.2}`` "
"``{ibba,bonds=1;orbital,2100.2;save,2100.2}`` "
"``{embed,highproc=ccsdt_proc,truncate=0.001;orbital,2100.2,local}``"
msgstr ""
"``truncate=value`` (默认 0.0) ``truncate`` 选项启用密度阈值方法，并且在使用此方法时必须始终提供一个正数。\\ "
"``truncate`` 值是每个基函数与之比较的最小总 Mulliken 布居。总布居大于此值的环境函数（根据角动量伙伴分组，例如 px 与 py 和"
" pz）将被保留。低于截断值的环境函数被分组并从嵌入后计算中丢弃。设置 ``truncate=0.0`` "
"相当于基组未被截断的情况，因为所有函数的总布居都大于 0。对于精确的类型内嵌能量，\\ ``truncate`` 通常不应超过 "
"0.001，尽管关于此参数的收敛性会根据体系和离域程度略有变化。例如：\\ ``proc ccsdt_proc`` ``endproc`` "
"``{ks;orbital,2100.2}`` ``{ibba,bonds=1;orbital,2100.2;save,2100.2}`` "
"``{embed,highproc=ccsdt_proc,truncate=0.001;orbital,2100.2,local}``"

msgid ""
"``STOREAO`` Stores the list of AO functions used for the truncated active "
"subsystem to a record on Molpro’s file system. If this record is present it "
"will be used as the list of AO basis functions to construct the truncated "
"basis of the active subsystem. This option can be used to retain the same "
"selected AO functions along a geometry scan or a reaction coordinate to "
"ensure a smooth potential energy surface. If one were to do a dissociation "
"reaction, it is recommended that the calculations always go from associated "
"to dissociated in order to benefit from this option."
msgstr ""
"``STOREAO`` 将用于截断活性子系统的原子轨道函数列表存储到 Molpro "
"文件系统的一个记录中。如果存在此记录，它将用作构建活性子系统截断基组的原子轨道基函数列表。此选项可用于在几何扫描或反应坐标上保留相同的选定原子轨道函数，以确保平滑的势能面。如果要进行解离反应，建议计算始终从结合态到解离态进行，以便从此选项中受益。"

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from the use of this method must acknowledge the "
"following:"
msgstr "所有使用此方法产生的出版物必须引用以下文献："

msgid "Gradients for Projection-based WF-in-DFT Embedding"
msgstr "投影式 WF-in-DFT 嵌入的梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytical nuclear gradients have been implemented for projection-based "
"wavefunction-in-DFT (WF-in-DFT) embedding with and without density threshold"
" truncation. The current available methods that can be used for the WF "
"method on the active subsystem (subsystem A) are CCSD(T), CCSD, MP2, and HF."
" The current available methods that can be used for the low-level SCF method"
" are LDA, GGAs, hybrid GGAs and HF. ECP gradients should also work for WF-"
"in-DFT both with and without density threshold truncation."
msgstr ""
"已为投影式波函数嵌入密度泛函理论（WF-in-DFT）嵌入（无论是否使用密度阈值截断）实现了解析核梯度。当前可用于活性子系统（子系统 "
"A）上波函数方法的方法有 CCSD(T)、CCSD、MP2 和 HF。当前可用于低级别 SCF 方法的方法有 LDA、GGA、杂化 GGA 和 "
"HF。ECP 梯度也应适用于使用或不使用密度阈值截断的 WF-in-DFT。"

msgid "**Important Notes:**"
msgstr "**重要说明：**"

msgid "Only closed-shell gradients are supported right now."
msgstr "目前仅支持闭壳层梯度。"

msgid ""
"Embedding gradients do not include the projector correction so the option "
"``HF_COR`` must be set to 0."
msgstr "嵌入梯度不包含投影校正，因此必须将选项 ``HF_COR`` 设置为 0。"

msgid ""
"If density threshold truncation (`density threshold method <projection-"
"based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#density-threshold-method>`__) is used a "
"lowproc must be specified for the type-in-type correction."
msgstr ""
"如果使用密度阈值截断（\\ `密度阈值方法 <projection-based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#density-"
"threshold-method>`__\\ ），则必须为 type-in-type 校正指定一个 lowproc。"

msgid "Density fitting embedding gradients are not supported right now."
msgstr "目前不支持密度拟合嵌入梯度。"

msgid ""
"Please note the following embedding gradient methods have not yet been "
"implemented: Multireference-WF-in-DFT, and DFT-in-DFT embedding."
msgstr "请注意，以下嵌入梯度方法尚未实现：多参考波函数嵌入密度泛函理论，以及 DFT-in-DFT 嵌入。"

msgid ""
"Example input files for gradients are located under the examples section "
"(`examples <projection-based_wf-in-dft_embedding.html#examples>`__)"
msgstr ""
"梯度计算的示例输入文件位于示例部分（\\ `示例 <projection-based_wf-in-"
"dft_embedding.html#examples>`__\\ ）"

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from the use of this method must acknowledge the "
"analytical WF-in-DFT nuclear gradients paper."
msgstr "所有使用此方法产生的出版物都必须引用解析 WF-in-DFT 核梯度论文。"

msgid "Embedding Gradient Options"
msgstr "嵌入梯度选项"

msgid ""
"``GRAD`` This option must be present in the ``EMBED`` directive when "
"calculating a projection-based embedding gradient."
msgstr "``GRAD`` 在计算基于投影的嵌入梯度时，此选项必须出现在 ``EMBED`` 指令中。"

msgid ""
"``CPKSTHR``\\ =value (default 1.d-6) This option specifies the convergence "
"threshold for the solutions of the coupled-perturbed Kohn-Sham equations."
msgstr "``CPKSTHR``\\ =值 (默认 1.d-6) 此选项指定耦合微扰Kohn-Sham方程解的收敛阈值。"

msgid "Embedding Gradient Best Practices"
msgstr "嵌入梯度最佳实践"

msgid ""
"We have found the best agreement between numerical gradients and analytical "
"gradients when using the Neese (NEESE) grids."
msgstr "我们发现，在使用Neese (NEESE) 格点时，数值梯度与解析梯度之间的一致性最佳。"

msgid "Grid weight derivatives should be calculated for all DFT quantities."
msgstr "应计算所有DFT量的格点权重导数。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Projection-Based Embedding"
msgstr "基于投影的嵌入"

msgid ""
"This example performs a HF-in-HF and CCSD(T)-in-HF calculation on methanol. "
"The HF-in-HF energy is numerically identical to the HF energy of the full "
"system. By replacing the initial HF calculation on the full system with a "
"DFT calculation, it is possible to perform HF-in-DFT and CCSD(T)-in-DFT "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"本示例对甲醇进行 HF-in-HF 和 CCSD(T)-in-HF 计算。HF-in-HF 的能量在数值上与完整体系的 HF "
"能量相同。通过将完整体系的初始 HF 计算替换为 DFT 计算，即可进行 HF-in-DFT 和 CCSD(T)-in-DFT 计算。"

msgid "Embedded Multiconfigurational Calculations"
msgstr "嵌入多组态计算"

msgid "This example performs an MCSCF-in-DFT calculation on butene."
msgstr "本示例对丁烯进行 MCSCF-in-DFT 计算。"

msgid "Density Threshold Truncation"
msgstr "密度阈值截断"

msgid ""
"This example performs a CCSD(T)-in-B3LYP calculation on a water dimer, using"
" the density-threshold method with a truncate value of 0.001."
msgstr "本示例对水二聚体进行 CCSD(T)-in-B3LYP 计算，使用密度阈值方法，截断值为 0.001。"

msgid "Open Shell System"
msgstr "开壳层体系"

msgid ""
"This example performs a RCCSD(T)-in-LDA calculation on the methoxy radical."
msgstr "本示例对甲氧基自由基进行 RCCSD(T)-in-LDA 计算。"

msgid "CCSD(T)-in-LDA Gradient Calculation"
msgstr "CCSD(T)-in-LDA 梯度计算"

msgid ""
"This example performs a CCSD(T)-in-LDA gradient calculation on ethanol."
msgstr "本示例对乙醇进行CCSD(T)-in-LDA梯度计算。"

msgid "CCSD(T)-in-LDA Gradient Calculation w/ Density Threshold Truncation"
msgstr "CCSD(T)-in-LDA梯度计算（含密度阈值截断）"

msgid ""
"This example performs a CCSD(T)-in-LDA gradient calculation with density "
"threshold truncation on ethanol."
msgstr "本示例对乙醇进行含密度阈值截断的CCSD(T)-in-LDA梯度计算。"

msgid "MP2-in-LDA Geometry Optimization"
msgstr "MP2-in-LDA几何优化"

msgid "This example performs a MP2-in-LDA geometry optimization on ethanol."
msgstr "本示例对乙醇进行MP2-in-LDA几何优化。"

msgid "MP2-in-LDA Geometry Optimization w/ Density Threshold Truncation"
msgstr "MP2-in-LDA几何优化（含密度阈值截断）"

msgid ""
"This example performs a MP2-in-LDA geometry optimization with density "
"threshold truncation on ethanol."
msgstr "本示例对乙醇进行含密度阈值截断的MP2-in-LDA几何优化。"

msgid ""
"A DFT calculation is performed on the full system to obtain a set of "
"canonical molecular orbitals (MOs)."
msgstr "对整个体系进行 DFT 计算，以获得一组正则分子轨道（MO）。"

msgid ""
"The canonical orbitals are localized using a localization method such as "
"Pipek-Mezey or intrinsic bond orbitals (IBOs)."
msgstr "使用诸如 Pipek-Mezey 或内禀成键轨道（IBO）等定域化方法对正则轨道进行定域化。"

msgid ""
"The occupied localized MOs (LMOs) are partitioned into two subsystems, "
"labeled the active subsystem (A) and the frozen subsystem (B)."
msgstr "占据的定域分子轨道（LMO）被划分为两个子系统，分别标记为活性子系统（A）和冻结子系统（B）。"

msgid ""
"The interaction potential between the two subsystems is calculated at the "
"DFT level."
msgstr "两个子系统之间的相互作用势在 DFT 水平上计算。"

msgid ""
"A WF-level calculation is performed on the LMOs in the active subsystem, "
"embedded in the DFT-level interaction potential produced by the electrons in"
" the frozen subsystem (B)."
msgstr "对活性子系统中的 LMO 进行 WF 水平计算，并将其嵌入到由冻结子系统（B）中的电子产生的 DFT 水平相互作用势中。"

