"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300544e>`__ **8**, 2564 (2012)"
msgstr ""
"Manby, M. Stella, J. D. Goodpaster, and T. F. Miller III, `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300544e>`__ **8**, 2564 (2012)"

